      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.9,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "S02",
      "file": "S02.mp3",
      "text": "西塞尔酒店的电梯忽然停了一下，又停了一下，轿厢空无一人。",
      "sha256": "6bf053d7482a1be34f466d398e4943683d82f8b72a4ed0d05b76e61e929d88a4",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "试音对决 02 由主创选定（2026-11-22）；悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑",
      "narration_id": "N01",
      "target_start": 6.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.014,
      "atempo": 1.0023,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S03",
      "file": "S03.mp3",
      "text": "她挤在门后，一会儿躲开，一会儿伸头，朝走廊深处张望。",
      "sha256": "28266f116d3de15df8bf50f5b30b62e3bf50b6d8afbdfd4f1e7131eefe344c71",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "试音对决 02 由主创选定（2026-11-22）；悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑",
      "narration_id": "N01",
      "target_start": 12.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.899,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.101
    },
    {
      "id": "S04",
      "file": "S04.mp3",
      "text": "她忽而贴近门缝，忽而缩回暗处，像是在躲，又像是在等。",
      "sha256": "9a666cccf10bcc01192c6928ea4d1796f1c6af6eb982adf988ac318df9d116d2",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "试音对决 02 由主创选定（2026-11-22）；悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑",
      "narration_id": "N01",
      "target_start": 18.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.827,
      "atempo": 1.1378,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S05",
      "file": "S05.mp3",
      "text": "这就是西塞尔酒店，洛杉矶市中心一栋被称为死亡之屋的旧楼。",
      "sha256": "0887f3849f6a380449744d623e853ebcce094004fb2cdf6537e77b7b05f28645",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "试音对决 02 由主创选定（2026-11-22）；悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑",
      "narration_id": "N01",
      "target_start": 24.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.304,
      "atempo": 1.0507,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S06",
      "file": "S06.mp3",
      "text": "蓝可儿来自加拿大，是一位在温哥华上大学的华裔学生。",
      "sha256": "7efd5606293432e0aaf0046415c1bead44c9d083d15610e8c871dbcc23ec0e83",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "试音对决 02 由主创选定（2026-11-22）；悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 30.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.201,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.799
    },
    {
      "id": "S07",
      "file": "S07.mp3",
      "text": "那年一月，她跟朋友们一起来到洛杉矶，开始这段假期。",
      "sha256": "69e8fd38c542438d7c6becb808db23912056a7e8db61c25a39637137654c91cf",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "试音对决 02 由主创选定（2026-11-22）；悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 36.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.725,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.275
    },
    {
      "id": "S08",
      "file": "S08.mp3",
      "text": "朋友们先行离开，她说还想再玩几天，于是独自留在酒店。",
      "sha256": "52b6c162a142d3741dea2e07545f96a4952b4ce00756d6f6c1d8778595822846",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "试音对决 02 由主创选定（2026-11-22）；悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 42.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.525,
      "atempo": 1.0875,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S09",
      "file": "S09.mp3",
      "text": "很快，她从所有人的视线里消失了，再也没有人见到她。",
      "sha256": "3fc1babe53987cd8a6c6e3885aa6ce33b6c622dcfb5a14819a4a0cb0beb71552",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "试音对决 02 由主创选定（2026-11-22）；悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 48.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.095,
      "atempo": 1.0159,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S10",
      "file": "S10.mp3",
      "text": "她最后留在监控里的身影，正是一月三十一日凌晨的这趟电梯。",
      "sha256": "9db984b6205fb6e7d48cb26e7f6ff02a717dc13055c0e90f8f230560ab2cf904",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "试音对决 02 由主创选定（2026-11-22）；悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 54.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.2,
      "atempo": 1.0333,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S11",
      "file": "S11.mp3",
      "text": "当警方把这段监控公布出来时，画面的每一秒都被放大。",
      "sha256": "25c87cc5ea65f6ae0705ec5e64238580f390b3c522b1c66497f8d752f8994daa",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "试音对决 02 由主创选定（2026-11-22）；悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 60.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.712,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.288
    },
    {
      "id": "S12",
      "file": "S12.mp3",
      "text": "她按亮了每一层按钮，又朝走廊望了一遍又一遍。",
      "sha256": "32a8fe6dbc575000e28442b23462188e2cdec8a0f887f69808f9f60ffbd232fb",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "试音对决 02 由主创选定（2026-11-22）；悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 66.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.435,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.565
    },
    {
      "id": "S13",
      "file": "S13.mp3",
      "text": "警方先按失踪人口立案，开始排查她最后去过的地方。",
      "sha256": "c1e69eddaa8f9f0af51ea9e9a67cf5927b7ec0830356e5ea1fe4dbcf8f552125",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "试音对决 02 由主创选定（2026-11-22）；悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑",
