      "target_start": 72.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.12,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.88
    },
    {
      "id": "S14",
      "file": "S14.mp3",
      "text": "她的房间原样留在那里，护照、手机和现金一件没少。",
      "sha256": "f0a87196824f3583591cfd4f9b51997b01bd18b07f0963248f0872d786e85f08",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "试音对决 02 由主创选定（2026-11-22）；悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 78.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.7,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.3
    },
    {
      "id": "S15",
      "file": "S15.mp3",
      "text": "十九天没人见过她，直到住客投诉水压不足，维修工上了屋顶。",
      "sha256": "30301fdad5011e49ff9d38cd02bba60a1dd2ba29214191c3f5050fde4343ac40",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "试音对决 02 由主创选定（2026-11-22）；悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 84.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.793,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.207
    },
    {
      "id": "S16",
      "file": "S16.mp3",
      "text": "二月十九日清晨，酒店接到投诉：房间水龙头没有水压。",
      "sha256": "eccb18551384466f26e49211416a7b6e2fcb18a58f2a0d4d2cf535a88f94422d",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "试音对决 02 由主创选定（2026-11-22）；悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 90.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.329,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.671
    },
    {
      "id": "S17",
      "file": "S17.mp3",
      "text": "他们打开屋顶水箱，盖子升起的一瞬，所有人的声音都停住了。",
      "sha256": "34b7830c3f49b6d59c4de1f1d20bc7f30459bb941765b5ee3227baedb6b5a0c1",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "试音对决 02 由主创选定（2026-11-22）；悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 96.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.631,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.369
    },
    {
      "id": "S18",
      "file": "S18.mp3",
      "text": "消失了十九天的她，终于在屋顶的水箱里被找到。",
      "sha256": "75c4559e22677fe3b1798e6ea3d09d1c1e0ab22170916fda9343c570bef6c546",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "试音对决 02 由主创选定（2026-11-22）；悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 102.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.516,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.484
    },
    {
      "id": "S19",
      "file": "S19.mp3",
      "text": "警方封锁了屋顶，全球媒体的镜头很快从四面八方涌来。",
      "sha256": "c1dd73aadde0c2c9ca5b941422b60e9085cbb3394376e4431b7098148ab21dee",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "试音对决 02 由主创选定（2026-11-22）；悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 108.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.712,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.288
    },
    {
      "id": "S20",
      "file": "S20.mp3",
      "text": "法医最终结论：溺水；没有挣扎痕迹，也没有任何嫌疑人。",
      "sha256": "344bf62c423b1d17bf920578ea4cc1002be735b68f20d98d0571066a67b8f7b6",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "试音对决 02 由主创选定（2026-11-22）；悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 114.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.734,
      "atempo": 1.1223,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S21",
      "file": "S21.mp3",
      "text": "所有人都盯上了那段电梯录像，她究竟在躲什么，还是在害怕什么？",
      "sha256": "2b93ee9ae62fb2c91c80893392d143b0c017a7c5405e4863a371ca1e9c7cae40",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "试音对决 02 由主创选定（2026-11-22）；悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 120.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.095,
      "atempo": 1.0159,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S22",
      "file": "S22.mp3",
      "text": "网上关于西塞尔的传言迅速发酵，所有人都在重看那段录像。",
      "sha256": "2b3a6bfccf2c3df1bf65f72477c0a7a98eaad86909248fe9c158a2c9857d208b",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "试音对决 02 由主创选定（2026-11-22）；悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 126.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.12,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.88
    },
    {
      "id": "S23",
      "file": "S23.mp3",
      "text": "可警方面对的现实很简单，除了那段录像，再也没有别的证据。",
      "sha256": "79c805770399bfc67a15e9db8d00614603ce9961fc887af6f6674d536e41c0c4",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "试音对决 02 由主创选定（2026-11-22）；悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 132.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.921,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.079
    },
    {
      "id": "S24",
      "file": "S24.mp3",
      "text": "官方给出的结论：溺水，与她的双相情感障碍相关。",
      "sha256": "f3a7d8597bff2cfee369da8a5398ad2f624d28f6bc45bbc98f75d7a49cdde688",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "试音对决 02 由主创选定（2026-11-22）；悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 138.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.4,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.6
    },
    {
      "id": "S25",
      "file": "S25.mp3",
      "text": "她当时有没有按医嘱服药，始终没人能给出确定答案。",
      "sha256": "ca1109f95974844862174557ae43b92c16d4096cb6036a81d571191f4ac78619",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "试音对决 02 由主创选定（2026-11-22）；悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 144.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.027,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.973
    },
    {
      "id": "S26",
      "file": "S26.mp3",
      "text": "后来，西塞尔歇业改建成平价住房，电梯却仍在日夜运行。",
      "sha256": "f52581e1a09f05ec8550d48388ab853e9d9662f19b534a4b29040952044c8652",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "试音对决 02 由主创选定（2026-11-22）；悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑",
      "narration_id": "N06",
